        "kind": "book",
        "book": "book-of-the-dead"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For tasks that require a lighter touch, gnome, goblin, and halfling remains are more suitable than a larger creature's. These smaller, nimbler skeletons fit well in a traveling chest, can be forced through tight spaces, and more easily avoid detection. Your size is Small instead of Medium. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "8d5acd26-e889-5893-a9e0-1bff8da9f84e"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " feat, even if you aren't trained in Acrobatics. Tight spaces not tight enough to require the Squeeze activity aren't difficult terrain for you."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "CreatureSize",
        "value": "small"
      },
